{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Rift is a  turn-based RPG set in a high-fantasy world where every decision can change the course of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Rift Guild and lead a party of heroes to explore ever-changing dungeons and uncover the secrets of the Arcane Rifts that threaten Amaram.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > War of the Crowns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/a5784c93ac910c7807d393c368e6182f.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=960 height=530 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/a5784c93ac910c7807d393c368e6182f.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/a5784c93ac910c7807d393c368e6182f.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amaram faces its greatest challenge.<br>The Amethyst Army of <strong>Throuzogard</strong> marches to seize the  <strong>Crown of Wisdom</strong> and complete the <strong>Triple Crown</strong>, an artifact powerful enough to make him a god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of the <strong>Rift</strong>\u00a0<strong>Guild</strong>, you are the last hope to protect the land and change the course of the war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draft your Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/6370885a5ba16d404abf9a3c1633041a.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/6370885a5ba16d404abf9a3c1633041a.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/6370885a5ba16d404abf9a3c1633041a.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge new builds with every run, finding powerful synergies through the random reward system at the end of battles or special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/025f35474e0abcc1203c283671b20a98.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=960 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/025f35474e0abcc1203c283671b20a98.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/025f35474e0abcc1203c283671b20a98.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit new<strong>\u00a0playable characters</strong>, discover more than <strong>50 pieces of equipment</strong>, and unlock over <strong>50 skills</strong> to create unique combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/9b6d8aff7f9e5f0079609f597e0d9aed.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=960 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/9b6d8aff7f9e5f0079609f597e0d9aed.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/9b6d8aff7f9e5f0079609f597e0d9aed.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters in battles against  Rift Guardians. Exploit their weaknesses, use buffs and debuffs at the right time, and combine abilities to turn the tide of combat.<br>Mastering each creature\u2019s weaknesses is essential to securing victory against the <strong>Amethyst Army</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/abdcadb0cc430ff21a07388557c3d6cb.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/abdcadb0cc430ff21a07388557c3d6cb.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/abdcadb0cc430ff21a07388557c3d6cb.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No adventure is ever the same.<br>Each run generates unique maps, filled with random events and choices that shape your journey. Perhaps you\u2019ll even find new allies along the way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034720?t=1774189268","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034720?t=1774189268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/f30295ef7bd8628ec0f65897ae5941e2fc574185/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774189268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/f30295ef7bd8628ec0f65897ae5941e2fc574185/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774189268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Rift is a  turn-based RPG set in a high-fantasy world where every decision can change the course of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Rift Guild and lead a party of heroes to explore ever-changing dungeons and uncover the secrets of the Arcane Rifts that threaten Amaram.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > War of the Crowns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/a5784c93ac910c7807d393c368e6182f.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=960 height=530 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/a5784c93ac910c7807d393c368e6182f.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/a5784c93ac910c7807d393c368e6182f.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amaram faces its greatest challenge.<br>The Amethyst Army of <strong>Throuzogard</strong> marches to seize the  <strong>Crown of Wisdom</strong> and complete the <strong>Triple Crown</strong>, an artifact powerful enough to make him a god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of the <strong>Rift</strong>\u00a0<strong>Guild</strong>, you are the last hope to protect the land and change the course of the war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draft your Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/6370885a5ba16d404abf9a3c1633041a.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/6370885a5ba16d404abf9a3c1633041a.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/6370885a5ba16d404abf9a3c1633041a.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge new builds with every run, finding powerful synergies through the random reward system at the end of battles or special events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/025f35474e0abcc1203c283671b20a98.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=960 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/025f35474e0abcc1203c283671b20a98.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/025f35474e0abcc1203c283671b20a98.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit new<strong>\u00a0playable characters</strong>, discover more than <strong>50 pieces of equipment</strong>, and unlock over <strong>50 skills</strong> to create unique combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/9b6d8aff7f9e5f0079609f597e0d9aed.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=960 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/9b6d8aff7f9e5f0079609f597e0d9aed.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/9b6d8aff7f9e5f0079609f597e0d9aed.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters in battles against  Rift Guardians. Exploit their weaknesses, use buffs and debuffs at the right time, and combine abilities to turn the tide of combat.<br>Mastering each creature\u2019s weaknesses is essential to securing victory against the <strong>Amethyst Army</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/abdcadb0cc430ff21a07388557c3d6cb.poster.avif?t=1774189268\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/abdcadb0cc430ff21a07388557c3d6cb.webm?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/extras/abdcadb0cc430ff21a07388557c3d6cb.mp4?t=1774189268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No adventure is ever the same.<br>Each run generates unique maps, filled with random events and choices that shape your journey. Perhaps you\u2019ll even find new allies along the way.</p>","developers":["Pixell Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034720/faa917e36905d729c2a6cab80d54a0b9cb3c1f46/header.jpg?t=1774189268","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64-bit) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3220 / AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2 compatible card (Intel HD 4000 / GTX 750 / R7 250X)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (64-bit) or equival