ngeons that shift with each session, recruit unique heroes, and uncover the secrets of the Arcane Rifts in an epic narrative with challenging combat.","steam_appid":4034720,"support_info":{"email":"help@pixell.games","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":null}